WEBVTT

00:00:03.213 --> 00:00:07.855
Group Order diners can save their food
allergies to their HUNGRY profile.

00:00:07.855 --> 00:00:10.215
We call these Allergen Alerts.

00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:12.762
Diners choose from 13 common allergens.

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:15.439
When someone in your group order has one,

00:00:15.439 --> 00:00:19.749
we flag it on the order and ask
you to confirm you can accommodate

00:00:19.749 --> 00:00:20.397
it.

00:00:20.397 --> 00:00:23.703
We only ask when an order
has allergen alerts.

00:00:23.703 --> 00:00:27.006
Orders without them work as usual.

00:00:27.006 --> 00:00:29.251
When an order has allergen alerts,

00:00:29.251 --> 00:00:32.420
your cutoff email shows
an Allergen Alert notice

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.147
at the top.

00:00:33.147 --> 00:00:36.437
Click the link in it
to review and respond.

00:00:36.437 --> 00:00:40.085
Or log in to your Chef Dashboard
and go to Allergen Alerts.

00:00:40.085 --> 00:00:45.537
You'll see every order with alerts
for the day you pick, and its status.

00:00:47.885 --> 00:00:51.037
Review each flagged item in the order.

00:00:51.037 --> 00:00:55.109
If you can accommodate all of
them, choose "I can accommodate all

00:00:55.109 --> 00:00:59.320
allergen alerts for this order,"
then click Submit Response.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.108
If there's one or more
you can't accommodate,

00:01:02.108 --> 00:01:05.701
choose "I cannot accommodate
one or more allergen alerts,"

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:08.241
select which items you can't accommodate,

00:01:08.241 --> 00:01:09.914
then click Submit Response.

00:01:09.914 --> 00:01:12.473
Our team will help you through it.

00:01:12.473 --> 00:01:17.330
Every order with allergen
alerts needs its own response.

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:20.627
Please respond as soon as
you get the cutoff email.

00:01:20.627 --> 00:01:23.729
If we don't hear from
you, we'll send a reminder

00:01:23.729 --> 00:01:26.574
and then a final reminder,
by email or text.

00:01:26.574 --> 00:01:29.891
After that, our team will contact you.

00:01:29.891 --> 00:01:33.040
Next, here are all the
places you and your kitchen

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.823
will see allergen alerts on an order.

00:01:35.823 --> 00:01:40.874
You've already seen the first one: the
notice at the top of your cutoff email.

00:01:40.874 --> 00:01:44.466
Your cutoff email also
includes the Kitchen Prep Doc.

00:01:44.466 --> 00:01:48.058
An Allergen Alerts box at
the top lists every flagged

00:01:48.058 --> 00:01:51.356
item, and each alert shows under its item.

00:01:51.356 --> 00:01:54.755
Labels show a warning tag
with the allergen next to the

00:01:54.755 --> 00:01:58.358
diner's name, so your team
can spot it at pack-out.

00:01:58.358 --> 00:02:01.816
The order manifest shows
an allergen alert banner at

00:02:01.816 --> 00:02:05.459
the top, and each alert
above the diner's order.

00:02:05.459 --> 00:02:10.541
On your Chef Dashboard, the calendar
shows a count of allergen alerts.

00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:13.898
Open the order to see an
allergen banner at the top

00:02:13.898 --> 00:02:17.443
and an Allergen Alert
column next to each item.

00:02:17.443 --> 00:02:21.175
The PDF order summary on
your Chef Dashboard shows the

00:02:21.175 --> 00:02:25.277
count at the top and the
alert under each item.

00:02:25.277 --> 00:02:25.903
Questions?

00:02:25.903 --> 00:02:28.342
Reach out to your Food Partner Manager.

00:02:28.342 --> 00:02:31.907
Thanks from the HUNGRY Food Partner Team.
